     Inset the glyph inside its own viewport so the 2px round-capped stroke
     (whose caps otherwise spill to x=0/24 & y~2/22) keeps a 1.5px margin on
     every side and is not clipped when the vector is scaled up into the 32dp
     icon slot. scale 0.875 + translate 1.5 recenters the 24u artwork.
    -->
